    {
      "sentence_id": 2,
      "japanese": "友人と電話で話していたときのことである。",
      "english_translation": "It was when I was talking on the phone with a friend."
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 3,
      "japanese": "その友人は何年も前に結婚していて、ちょうどそのころ、６歳の娘さんと４歳の息子さんを育てていた。",
      "english_translation": "That friend had been married for several years, and at that time, she was raising a 6-year-old daughter and a 4-year-old son."
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 4,
      "japanese": "「二人もいると、子育てが大変だね。",
      "english_translation": "\"It must be so difficult raising children when you have two.\""
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 5,
      "japanese": "」そんな私の言葉に、彼女はくすくすと笑い出した。",
      "english_translation": "\"She started to giggle at my words.\""
